{"id":"huntik:page:8116","page_id":8116,"title":"Firebrand","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Firebrand is a spell that creates a fiery aura of purple energy on the caster's hands.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S1E25_Rassimov_firebrand.jpg","wikitext":"File:S1E25_Rassimov_firebrand.jpg","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Violet","wikitext":"Violet","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Offensive","wikitext":"Offensive","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Kiel\nRassimov","wikitext":"[[Kiel]]<br>[[Rassimov]]","links":[{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"}]},"first":{"text":"\"The Divine Comedy\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Divine Comedy]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Divine Comedy","label":"The Divine Comedy","target_id":"huntik:page:5040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Divine_Comedy","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5040"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"Infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S1E25_Rassimov_firebrand.jpg","value_text":"File:S1E25_Rassimov_firebrand.jpg","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Violet","value_text":"Violet","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Offensive","value_text":"Offensive","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Kiel]]<br>[[Rassimov]]","value_text":"Kiel\nRassimov","links":[{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Divine Comedy]]\"","value_text":"\"The Divine Comedy\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Divine Comedy","label":"The Divine Comedy","target_id":"huntik:page:5040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Divine_Comedy","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5040"}]}],"start":0,"end":168}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This spell was used by [[Rassimov]] against [[Dante Vale]] at [[the Professor's castle]] and was used to melt a metal rod in two to use both flaming ends as weapons. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}\n\n[[Kiel]] used the spell break through a force field set up by [[Focauld Casterwill]] in the [[The Cloisters]]. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\nRassimov later used Firebrand in his final battle with Dante at the [[Spiral Mark]]. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}","text":"This spell was used by Rassimov against Dante Vale at the Professor's castle and was used to melt a metal rod in two to use both flaming ends as weapons. [The Divine Comedy]\n\nKiel used the spell break through a force field set up by Focauld Casterwill in the The Cloisters. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\nRassimov later used Firebrand in his final battle with Dante at the Spiral Mark. [The Spiral Mark]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Marque-feu\n}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","text":"French: Marque-feu"}],"full_text":"Firebrand is a spell that creates a fiery aura of purple energy on the caster's hands.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by Rassimov against Dante Vale at the Professor's castle and was used to melt a metal rod in two to use both flaming ends as weapons. [The Divine Comedy]\n\nKiel used the spell break through a force field set up by Focauld Casterwill in the The Cloisters. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\nRassimov later used Firebrand in his final battle with Dante at the Spiral Mark. [The Spiral Mark]\n\n==International Names==","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E25_Rassimov_firebrand.jpg\n| aura  = Violet\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Kiel]]<br>[[Rassimov]]\n| first = \"[[The Divine Comedy]]\"\n}}'''Firebrand''' is a spell that creates a fiery aura of purple energy on the caster's hands.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by [[Rassimov]] against [[Dante Vale]] at [[the Professor's castle]] and was used to melt a metal rod in two to use both flaming ends as weapons. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}\n\n[[Kiel]] used the spell break through a force field set up by [[Focauld Casterwill]] in the [[The Cloisters]]. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\nRassimov later used Firebrand in his final battle with Dante at the [[Spiral Mark]]. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}\n\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Marque-feu\n}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Magic","Offensive spells","Violet-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"The Divine Comedy","label":"The Divine Comedy","target_id":"huntik:page:5040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Divine_Comedy","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5040"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","tar